        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">近戰武器攻擊</em>：命中+5，觸及5尺，單一目標。<em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">命中：</em>7（1d8+3）點鈍擊傷害，雙手持用時8（1d10+3）點鈍擊傷害，外加3（1d6）點火焰傷害。</p><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> [[/r 1d20+5]]{+5} to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> 7 ([[/damage 1d8 + 3 type=bludgeoning]]) damage, or 8 ([[/damage 1d10 + 3 type=bludgeoning]]) damage if used with two hands to make a melee attack, plus 3 ([[/damage 1d6 type=fire]]) damage.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
